estamp="481">08:01</a> 短波收音机里的台湾：中央广播电台「台北国际之声」与「亚洲之声」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1072">17:52</a> 蔡康永、陈文茜、赵少康… 那些从电台里认识的名人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1171">19:31</a> 迷恋「陪伴感」：为何我依然想做这种「效率不高」的节目</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1267">21:07</a> 花园会员福利：解锁第一期「声音盲盒」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1413">23:33</a> 音乐：Buttons and Bows, Dinah Shore, 1948</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">32:00</a> 由苹果西打引发的联想：英国超市的水果碗如何「拯救」了我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2594">43:14</a> 算法时代的「羞耻记录」：如何面对自己「肤浅」的喜好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2709">45:09</a> 音乐：</span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XGRcWcp8z2E" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XGRcWcp8z2E"><span>Taylor Swift - The Fate of Ophelia (1980's Version)</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2874">47:54</a> </span><a href="https://www.nytimes.com/2025/10/21/opinion/taylor-swift-life-showgirl-conservative.html" data-url="https://www.nytimes.com/2025/10/21/opinion/taylor-swift-life-showgirl-conservative.html"><span>《纽约时报》专栏作家Ross Douthat：TS新专「粗俗又保守」</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3157">52:37</a> </span><a href="https://www.economist.com/business/2025/10/30/linkedin-and-the-art-of-self-promotion" data-url="https://www.economist.com/business/2025/10/30/linkedin-and-the-art-of-self-promotion"><span>《经济学人》：LinkedIn上的自我推销艺术</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3351">55:51</a> 近期行程：</span><a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/227-tickets-1861658774509" data-url="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/227-tickets-1861658774509"><span>11月16日纽约线下分享「我与媒体的关系」</span></a></p>]]></description>
