  <item>
    <title>与闾丘露薇聊天</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64aab227274b6a2afe8965bc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64aab227274b6a2afe8965bc</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 09 Jul 2023 13:11:31 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是一期“假公济私”的访谈，借由主持《去现场》的机会，与对我的职业生涯有着很深影响的知名记者闾丘露薇坐下来聊了聊。闾丘刚刚推出她的新书，是一本小说《浮世蔷薇》。因为是一次“假公济私”的聊天，所以这期节目中没有你想象中那个“战地玫瑰”非聊不可的话题。相反，作为闾丘多年的粉丝，我和她谈了一些在以往她的各种访谈和公开演讲中，没有太多提及，但我个人又十分感兴趣的话题。一位八十年代末的哲学系学生所感受到的时代之变，九十年代中叶香港作为亚太传媒之都的繁荣景象，电视记者与博客、微博等等不同社交平台碰撞之后为电视报道带来了怎样的影响与改变，从业二十年的资深记者如何转型成为新闻传播学者。</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目结尾提到的闾丘露薇的Newsletter，请</span><a href="https://roseluqiu.substack.com/" data-url="https://roseluqiu.substack.com/"><span>点击这里订阅</span></a><span>。我的Newsletter，</span><a href="https://yang1989yi.substack.com/" data-url="https://yang1989yi.substack.com/"><span>请点击这里</span></a><span>，欢迎订阅。</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 延伸阅读 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>- </span><a href="https://roseluqiu.substack.com/" data-url="https://roseluqiu.substack.com/"><span>闾丘露薇的Newsletter</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>- </span><a href="https://www.books.com.tw/products/0010959992" data-url="https://www.books.com.tw/products/0010959992"><span>浮世蔷薇</span></a><span>，闾丘露薇，二○四六出版，2023年6月</span></p><span></span><p><span>- </span><a href="https://niemanreports.org/articles/blogging-news-in-china/" data-url="https://niemanreports.org/articles/blogging-news-in-china/"><span>Blogging News in China (Nieman Reports)</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>- </span><a href="https://www.amazon.com/Propaganda-Media-Nationalism-Mainland-China/dp/1498573142/" data-url="https://www.amazon.com/Propaganda-Media-Nationalism-Mainland-China/dp/1498573142/"><span>Propaganda, Media, and Nationalism in Mainland China and Hong Kong</span></a><span>, Luwei Rose Luqiu, Lexington Books, 2018年10月</span></p><span></span><p><span>- </span><a href="https://www.jstor.org/stable/48671506" data-url="https://www.jstor.org/stable/48671506"><span>Wolf Warriors and Diplomacy in the New Era</span></a><span>, Yaoyao Dai, Luwei Rose Luqiu, China Review, 2022年5月</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 制作团队 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>编辑 杨一</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目统筹